{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 585688, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 117912, "uid": 154257, "type": 4, "title": "WB角色总表", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1678514140, "updated_at": 1683347811, "updated_uid": 154257, "comment_at": 1678514140, "last_at": 1683347811, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "本表是WB的组队基础。WB的组队技巧和RB正好相反，最快的捷径就是不试图走捷径，把所有主要技能都排上角色，自然就是策划设计的队伍，具体使用方法如下：1.排入当期有利属性行中所有角色，如某列为空白，则排", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_5011/h_3117/1164/154257/2023/4/6/867966.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 7, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 5294, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "吉林省", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 1, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 585688, "content": "<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">本表是WB的组队基础。</span><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">WB的组队技巧和RB正好相反，最快的捷径就是不试图走捷径，把所有主要技能都排上角色，自然就是策划设计的队伍，具体使用方法如下：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">1. 排入当期有利属性行中所有角色，如某列</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">为空白，则排入跨属行中该列角色。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">2. 如果连跨属角色也没有，用游戏内筛选功能换成相同技能自己有的角色，注意可能产生技能冲突。当自己持有表中角色，但练度过低，而替代角色练度较高时，也可能有替换价值。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">3. 排入奶、刀和维持生存或克制BOSS所需的</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">额外</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">角色，普通</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">队伍到此基本已满，</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">高练度队伍此处只需刀，因此还能排入更多角色。</span><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">4. 就本表创建时的环境而言，高练度玩家的空位都用于追加对光系加速的投入，其核心意义是通过提高薇薇安和光琴效率，间接进一步提高刀的转速。如普通玩家的薇薇安和光琴既要给刀加速也要给自身加速，最多只能点火后打SNNNN，但高练度玩家有空位能额外上光相机和光莫娜给前两者基础加速，使其专心打N，甚至可能还有余力上给前两者的满充、拉条、时间歪曲等更多加速。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"5011\" data-height=\"3117\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_5011/h_3117/1164/154257/2023/4/6/867966.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_5011/h_3117/1164/154257/2023/4/6/867966.jpg\"></div><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_5011/h_3117/1164/154257/2023/4/6/867966.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 154257, "username": "时崎狂肝", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/7.png", "description": "人生就像一场电影，总要有人演写攻略的。", "follow_num": 46, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 227688, "content_num": 55, "read_num": 253212, "like_num": 426}, "update_user": {"uid": 154257, "username": "时崎狂肝", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/7.png", "description": "人生就像一场电影，总要有人演写攻略的。", "follow_num": 46, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1164, "name": "天命之子日服",